OL,3,CAngela Rayner promises planning shake-
OL,4,Cup to tackle housing crisis
OL,6,FThousands more homes could be built
OL,7,Fnear railway stations, while pubs will
OL,8,Fbe given extra protection from being
OL,9,Fclosed under new measures designed to
OL,10,Fstreamline England's planning system.
OL,12,FHousing Secretary Angela Rayner said a
OL,13,Fshift to a "default yes" to
OL,14,Fdevelopments around stations in
OL,15,FEngland would help "tackle the housing
OL,16,Fcrisis and raise living standards".
OL,26,@uD@LOUuD@XO]wD@TOUxD@bO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/10
