FL,319,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1786970910
OL,3,CAngela Rayner promises planning shake-
OL,4,Cup to tackle housing crisis
OL,6,FThe new National Planning Policy
OL,7,FFramework, published on Monday, says
OL,8,Fthere will be default approval for
OL,9,Fhomes built within "reasonable walking
OL,10,Fdistance of well-connected stations".
OL,12,FThe change comes as the government is
OL,13,Fjust over a quarter of the way to its
OL,14,Ftarget of building 1.5 million homes
OL,15,Fbefore August 2029 in England, after
OL,16,Ftwo years of the five-year parliament.
OL,26,@qD@TOUrD@dO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1786970910
OL,3,CAngela Rayner promises planning shake-
OL,4,Cup to tackle housing crisis
OL,6,F"A safe, secure home is the foundation
OL,7,Fof opportunity, but too many people
OL,8,Fare being priced out of the
OL,9,Fcommunities where they want to live
OL,10,Fand work," the housing secretary said.
OL,12,F"By unlocking thousands of homes
OL,13,Faround well-connected transport hubs,
OL,14,Fwe're helping people live closer to
OL,15,Fwork, school and the services they
OL,16,Frely on, while backing local
OL,17,Fbusinesses and driving growth in our
OL,18,Fcommunities.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@JO]tD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1786970910
OL,3,CAngela Rayner promises planning shake-
OL,4,Cup to tackle housing crisis
OL,6,F"That's how we'll tackle the housing
OL,7,Fcrisis and raise living standards for
OL,8,Fpeople in every corner of the country."
OL,10,FDespite Prime Minister Andy Burnham's
OL,11,Fpromises of devolution, the planning
OL,12,Freforms will mean local stakeholders'
OL,13,Fpositions on planning proposals will
OL,14,Fcarry less weight if they clash with
OL,15,Fnational decision-making policy.
OL,17,FFor example, the plans to protect pubs
OL,18,Fwill make it harder for developers to
OL,19,Fturn them into flats or shops.
OL,26,@nD@AOUpD@gO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1786970910
OL,3,CAngela Rayner promises planning shake-
OL,4,Cup to tackle housing crisis
OL,6,FOfficials said pubs and music venues
OL,7,Fare the lifeblood of communities and
OL,8,Fthe changes will prevent them from
OL,9,Fbeing lost without good reason.
OL,11,FUnder the changes, which will come
OL,12,Finto effect immediately, developers
OL,13,Fmust prove there is no reasonable
OL,14,Fprospect of keeping a pub afloat
OL,15,Fbefore a change of use can be
OL,16,Fconsidered, the Sunday Times reported.
OL,18,FThe shake-up will also cut bureaucracy
OL,19,Fby ending the statutory requirement to
OL,20,Fconsult some organisations on
OL,21,Fdevelopment decisions.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
