FL,319,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31806
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1786970910
OL,3,CAngela Rayner promises planning shake-
OL,4,Cup to tackle housing crisis
OL,6,FUnder the new system, Sport England
OL,7,Fwill continue to advise on
OL,8,F"significant" cases and the Gardens
OL,9,FTrust and Theatres Trust will only be
OL,10,Fnotified about relevant applications.
OL,12,FChancellor John Healey said: "We want
OL,13,Fto drive growth in every postcode and
OL,14,Fhelp more working people into home
OL,15,Fownership.
OL,17,F"A secure home is the heart of all our
OL,18,Flives, helping people put down roots,
OL,19,Fplan for the future and build a good
OL,20,Flife for themselves and their families.
OL,26,@pD@AOUpD@MO]tD@^OUyD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/10
