OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1786970910
OL,3,CAngela Rayner promises planning shake-
OL,4,Cup to tackle housing crisis
OL,6,F"This is about creating opportunity,
OL,7,Fprosperity and stronger communities
OL,8,Facross the country."
OL,10,FThe latest estimate is that 392,400
OL,11,Fnet additional homes had been
OL,12,Fdelivered in England between July 2024
OL,13,Fwhen Labour came into office and June
OL,14,F14 this year.
OL,26,@nD@AOUpD@TO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/10
