PN,31808
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1786970910
OL,3,CAngela Rayner promises planning shake-
OL,4,Cup to tackle housing crisis
OL,6,FAround 600,000 new homes would need to
OL,7,Fhave been added in the first two years
OL,8,Fto keep pace with the 1.5 million
OL,9,Ftarget over five years, although
OL,10,Fministers are hopeful that planning
OL,11,Freforms will speed up delivery in the
OL,12,Fcoming years.
