PN,31809
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1786970910
OL,3,CAngela Rayner promises planning shake-
OL,4,Cup to tackle housing crisis
OL,6,FThe Garden Trust said it was
OL,7,F"devastating news" that the
OL,8,Forganisation would no longer be a
OL,9,Fstatutory consultee, warning it will
OL,10,Fput parks at risk.
OL,12,FTrust chairman John Watkins said:
OL,13,F"This devalues these special places
OL,14,Fand makes them vulnerable to poorly
OL,15,Finformed development."
OL,17,FShadow housing secretary Sir James
OL,18,FCleverly said Labour was "failing
OL,19,Fabysmally" to meet the 1.5 million
OL,20,Fhomes target.
OL,26,@oD@AOUoD@RO]uD@AOUwD@VO]zD@ZOU{D@JO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31810
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1786970910
OL,3,CAngela Rayner promises planning shake-
OL,4,Cup to tackle housing crisis
OL,6,F"To try to fix their own mess, Labour
OL,7,Fare planning a power grab, seizing
OL,8,Fcontrol from local communities and
OL,9,Fforcing them to accept development in
OL,10,Fthe wrong areas because Labour won't
OL,11,Fbuild in the right areas," he said.
OL,13,FCleverly said the PM "is going to
OL,14,Foverrule councils on green belt
OL,15,Fdevelopment and launch a new campaign
OL,16,Fof garden grabbing".
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@ZO]uD@VOUxD@SO]
